### 获取所有商品分类
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取指定ID的商品分类
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/detail/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 创建商品分类
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "name": "衣服",
  "description": "各类衣服，包括T恤、裤子、连衣裙等"
}

### 更新商品分类
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "name": "数码产品",
  "description": "更新后的描述"
}

### 删除商品分类
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取分类下的所有商品
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取分类详情（包含商品列表）
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1/with-products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
